From: Home Automation Kit laboratory
Subject: [EXPERIMENT] Rebase Hantro H.264 encoder prototype onto Linux 7.2.11

Compile-only adaptation of Paul Kocialkowski (Bootlin) and Michael Grzeschik
(Pengutronix) work at d0897ac6844c86a8d8d6f90d4116eb068184010c.
